# Codabench submission zips are results, not build artifacts -- they are the only thing a
# teammate can actually submit, and every Qwen run folder tracks one. A local `*.zip` rule
# in .git/info/exclude was silently dropping them. .gitignore takes precedence over
# info/exclude, so this negation keeps them tracked.
!**/prediction_en.zip
